%N A394635 Isolated totient numbers: even totient numbers k such that k-2 and k+2 are not totient numbers.
%H A394635 Jud McCranie, <a href="/A394635/b394635.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%e A394635 36 is a totient number but 34 and 38 are not, so 36 is in the sequence.
%o A394635 (PARI) isok(k) = !(k%2) && istotient(k) && !istotient(k-2) && !istotient(k+2); \\ _Michel Marcus_, Sep 30 2026
